  \n\n shareholders and active traders to facilitate communication and discussion among one another. Feel free to join the group and share your insights on stock market trends. Please click https://t.co/M5hdum1jQi", "url": "https://x.com/tokoyamada_com/status/2117362061449834711"}, {"author_id": "143126563", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:50:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117358648200413609"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "University, national lab and industry partners scaled electron-beam-printed tungsten from fingertip-sized samples to full divertor tiles, which survived high-power plasma in the DIII-D National Fusion Facility.", "display_url": "ncst.at/gsSR5102cS4", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://ncst.at/gsSR5102cS4", "images": [{"height": 1442, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358658409340928/Qdu7KjV6?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358658409340928/Qdu7KjV6?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 247, "status": 200, "title": "NC State and Oak Ridge 3D-Print Tungsten Tiles for Use In Fusion Facility", "unwound_url": "https://engr.ncsu.edu/news/2026/10/26/nc-state-and-oak-ridge-3d-print-tungsten-tiles-for-use-in-fusion-facility/?utm_campaign=coecomm&utm_medium=social&utm_source=X?utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social&utm_content=ncstateengr&utm_campaign=socialhub&utm_term=ff5544a6-a589-42c4-921c-8b17fa8b6db6", "url": "https://t.co/cPPxO0Hbt9"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pzN5CF2tKy", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NCStateEngr/status/2117358648200413609/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117358644991856640", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/pzN5CF2tKy"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pzN5CF2tKy", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NCStateEngr/status/2117358648200413609/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117358644886941696", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/pzN5CF2tKy"}]}, "id": "2117358648200413609", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_cou